.TH AVR\-SKILL\-SHOW 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-show \- Print the avr guide for coding agents.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill show
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the avr guide for coding agents.
.PP
The guide covers testing a change in CI, diagnosing failed or slow runs, structured output and on-demand VMs for the installed avr version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-uninstall (1)
